{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "Before you look at the SMS plan in docs/work/sms/plan.md: I deliberately do not want texts to go through the Notifier protocol. Twilio is flaky, and I want SMS kept completely separate from email so that a Twilio outage can never touch the notifier loop. A standalone send_sms called after the loop is the shape I want."}, "uuid": "7cd274ce-6e20-4bfd-999e-cc037eace40e", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T21:00:00.000Z", "turnOrigin": "sdk", "cwd": "/eval/cwd", "sessionId": "e7a9bdc9-eb63-4010-b06a-89067ac478be"}
{"parentUuid": "7cd274ce-6e20-4bfd-999e-cc037eace40e", "isSidechain": false, "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_9cd0a67ebfb646c7ac8d69e7", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "That makes sense. Keeping SMS out of the Notifier list isolates Twilio failures from the email path, and calling send_sms after the loop means the email always goes out first. A separate path is the right call here, so the plan's split between send_sms and the notifiers is intentional and should not be treated as a second mechanism."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 677, "cache_read_input_tokens": 37197, "output_tokens": 1978, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 741}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 677, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 1978, "cache_read_input_tokens": 37197, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 677, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 677}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "apiBlockIndex": 1, "requestRef": "602890c1-b457-4caf-aa67-d2f4d7ff2b80", "requestedModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "promptCacheRequested": "1h", "attributionSkill": "oberpierre-skills:grill", "attributionPlugin": "oberpierre-skills", "type": "assistant", "uuid": "c8114ae3-cc81-477f-9cb9-a77bdd8fb824", "timestamp": "2026-11-14T21:00:05.000Z", "advisorModel": "claude-opus-5-5", "effort": "medium", "perTurnEffort": "medium", "madeBy": "model", "cwd": "/eval/cwd", "sessionId": "e7a9bdc9-eb63-4010-b06a-89067ac478be"}
